      "writtenOn": "2019-01-25T12:39:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to keep this function as simple as possible, so will check the relationship between provider and capabilities at the SetUp of each tests.\n- GetProviderCapabilitiesHelper: checks PCM and codec capability for SW and HW respectively.\n- OpenProviderHelper: checks status and provider are on the same page.\n- BluetoothAudioProviderA2dpSoftwareHidlTest: checks the provider must be valid.\n- BluetoothAudioProviderA2dpHardwareHidlTest: checks the provider must be valid when capability is not empty (LINE#386).\n- BluetoothAudioProvidersFactoryHidlTest: checks the provider must be valid.\nOr, do you think I should merge OpenProviderBySession and getProviderCapabilitiesBySession into one test case? \n  TEST_F(OpenProviderBySession + getProviderCapabilitiesBySession) {\n    for all sessions {\n      GetProviderCapabilitiesHelper + OpenProviderHelper\n      ASSERT when capability is not empty and provider is nullptr\n    }\n  }",
      "parentUuid": "6af6a4cb_7e9b4b19",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 266,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 266,
        "endChar": 79
